        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Decorative Acrylic Appliance Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100%\"  border=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"center\"  width=\"300\" class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\nThe detailed filigree end brackets of this truly unique decorative appliance door pull will add incredible beauty to your dishwasher and refrigerator doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest acrylic available. The acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. Available in your choice of <b>Frosted or Clear Acrylic</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\" thick refrigerator/appliance door panel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"center\" align=\"center\" width=\"280\" class=\"text\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-910-size.gif?v=1704354497\" width=\"260\" height=\"260\" border=\"0\" alt=\"door pull filigree detail\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Decorative Atlantic Acrylic Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262239\"><b>First Impressions ATL100SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-ATL100009SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-ATL100012SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-ATL100018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-ATL100024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 21-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
