                "description": "Available lengths of 9 inches, 12 inches, 18 inches, or 24 inches in your choice of Frosted or Clear Acrylic. The detailed filigree end brackets of this truly unique decorative appliance door pull will add incredible beauty to your dishwasher and refrigerator doors.",
